=== Vice-presidency (1795) ===

The office of vice president was added to the [[Constitution of Sinchew|constitution]] by amendment in 1795, in the same year that a new presidential election was held after the death of a president in office.

=== Arms case (1797) ===

A constitutional challenge was brought in 1797 on the regulation of arms. It was argued that the possession of arms was the means by which expression could be maintained. The challenge was struck down, and the provinces are competent to regulate the ownership of arms.

=== Provincial Restructuring Act (1826) ===

The [[Provincial Restructuring Act]] of 1826 redrew the country's internal boundaries and created the sixteen provinces that exist at present, with the exception of [[Palpoa Province|Palpoa]].

